# Original hero footage — source material only.
# These are the full-quality masters to upload to Shopify admin under
# Content -> Files. They are 60MB and 7MB, far past Shopify's 20MB theme
# asset ceiling, and are never served from the theme. The compressed copies
# the hero actually falls back to are assets/ness-hero-*.mp4, which ARE
# tracked.
assets/nav1.mp4
assets/wedding.mp4

# Original section photography — source material only.
# Camera originals (2-22MB, up to 5852x8192). about2.JPG alone is 21.8MB,
# past Shopify's 20MB asset ceiling. The web-sized copies the theme actually
# serves are assets/ness-services-*.jpg and assets/ness-about-*.jpg, which
# ARE tracked.
assets/instlaation.jpg
assets/sewing.jpg
assets/natural.jpg
assets/about1.JPG
assets/about2.JPG
assets/Luxury styles.MOV
